  "docs": "Requires Tailwind CSS v4 — these values are raw hex/rgba, not v3 hsl channels. This registry item carries color, radius and shadow tokens ONLY. It cannot carry the Pretendard/Poppins @import rules or the 19 .ta-* typography classes, so after installing you must still copy those blocks from assets/tecace-theme.css into your globals.css — otherwise the display font (Poppins numerics) and the whole type scale will be missing.",
